Usage: gccli groups leaderboard <id> [flags]

Rank the members of a group by steps, calories, pushes or distance.

Arguments:
  <id>    Group ID.

Flags:
  -h, --help                 Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                 Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header               Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                             output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"         Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING       Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"         Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                             elevations and weights in table and plain output:
                             auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                             statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version              Print version information.

      --metric="steps"       What to rank: steps, calories, pushes or distance.
                             The first three show nothing for a group you have
                             not joined.
      --activity=ACTIVITY    Count only the distance of one activity: walking,
                             running, cycling, swimming or pushing. Only with
                             --metric distance.
      --start=DATE           First day (YYYY-MM-DD, today, yesterday, 3d, +30d).
                             Default: Monday of this week.
      --end=DATE             Last day. Default: 6 days after --start.
  -l, --limit=20             Maximum number of members to return.
      --offset=0             Number of members to skip.

